      "Case studies on the 'Old Faithful' Geyser dataset and Swiss Bank Notes dataset demonstrate that the method successfully identifies main groups, detects contamination levels, and flags observations that are not 'comfortable' within their assigned clusters.",
      "While standard trimmed $k$-means assumes spherical distributions, extending the criterion using scatter estimation matrices successfully handles non-spherical (linear/elliptical) mixtures."
